IMG_20240823_120758.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div id="bottom"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#top"&gt;回到最新&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;</description></item><item><title>四月游记</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/</link><pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 01:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post 四月游记" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="四月游记"&gt;四月游记&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;2024年4月北京旅游记录&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="4月14日"&gt;4月14日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;早上起个大早赶飞机&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="航站楼" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-083912.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-083912_hu_e8ffc64e2730f46f.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-083912_hu_1d6c7080651ab2ae.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-083912_hu_ee3acbff90628032.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-083912.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;位置选了最后一排双人座，前面都是三人，没想到旁边没人，i人爽到&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="座位" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-084144.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-084144_hu_ee549970bf7205b8.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-084144_hu_cea9d43ebb704ed.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-084144_hu_b2cfbe3b5d765e6c.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-084144.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;第一次真正意义上坐飞机&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="窗户" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-103359.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-103359_hu_f5765904e86b318b.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-103359_hu_43acd13ca2558540.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-103359_hu_66c41b7c4bc48eb2.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-103359.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;下飞机了，也是第一次坐上摆渡车&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="摆渡车" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-124935.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-124935_hu_b29e04eb00b842f0.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-124935_hu_bd79ccfd3abacc0c.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-124935_hu_a083de6e9bd894c4.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-124935.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;午餐就是飞机餐，下飞机后坐地铁先到民宿休息了下，然后吃晚饭&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;先到第二天的主线任务位置踩点&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="医院" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="3000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-184933.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-184933_hu_33248650e9a699a1.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-184933_hu_5d2fda494491601f.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-184933_hu_8fe208794238293a.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240414-184933.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;晚上就在床上看了会电子书&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="4月15日"&gt;4月15日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;早上第一次吃煎饼&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;然后赶去医院面试，过啦&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;中午回去平复了下心情，补了个觉&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;晚上出去随便走走！&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;先去了单推人的大学&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Ruby University" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-190719.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-190719_hu_e998925cc99e3857.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-190719_hu_4abfc66a8c7a8cc.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-190719_hu_204495639a6b32f0.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-190719.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;其实是到了北京在看地图的时候才发现在复试地点隔壁的&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;刷身份证就能进，好好好&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;然后去了奥体中心&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="鸟巢" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-205529.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-205529_hu_22c55127795a29db.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-205529_hu_3cf61b2b8a3c8f27.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-205529_hu_ebdb5abc2e27e8ef.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240415-205529.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;从南到北走了一圈就回来了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="4月16日"&gt;4月16日&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;六点多就醒了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;还是煎饼起手&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="煎饼" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-065204.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-065204_hu_1cedd1ddcb605233.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-065204_hu_6ae25af6c96986b0.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-065204_hu_a9754b84e8ef601f.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-065204.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;去了天安门&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;到天安门西才知道没预约连走路都不行，必须坐地铁原路返回&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;后来绕道对面国家大剧院，发现不能走路但是可以骑车&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;扫了一辆共享单车，如愿看到了天安门，p人魅力时刻&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="天安门" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-084721.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-084721_hu_3003bc668117b76a.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-084721_hu_63a8e5bb0c5e528f.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-084721_hu_844b93cc463be0c1.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-084721.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;然后去了王府井，但是感觉没什么好逛的，可能是太早了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;继续走到了……&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="协和" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="180px" data-flex-grow="75" height="4000" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090835.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090835_hu_80a97937750a85f1.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090835_hu_8cc91820e4737a13.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090835_hu_cc56ba72370c76db.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090835.webp 3000w" width="3000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;对面的礼堂&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="礼堂" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2230" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090912.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090912_hu_a8160482686e9550.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090912_hu_3fe7da2d5496aeaa.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090912_hu_36e63e73fcf904c.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-090912.webp 3964w" width="3964"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;之后不知道去哪，上小红书看到了附近有一条步行街叫南锣鼓巷：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="南锣鼓巷" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="2250" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-093939.webp" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-093939_hu_feff810e223d723e.webp 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-093939_hu_314ffcd4a7fb8920.webp 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-093939_hu_49a4f5dd02af96b2.webp 2400w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/240417-apr-travel/img/20240416-093939.webp 4000w" width="4000"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;逛完了回民宿退房的路上收到了航班取消的消息，本来下午还想去地坛玩的，临时改签到下午航班只好马不停蹄赶往机场了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;没有留下遗憾，因为知道马上就要再来了&lt;/p&gt;&#10;</description></item></channel></rss>